{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burning Night</strong> is a fast-paced 3D action game designed to be easy to pick up. With simple attack mechanics and intuitive health and energy systems, even players with little experience in action games can quickly get into the flow by finding the right strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The enemy executes rapid combo attacks and deals high amounts of damage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717860/extras/b9bb13f9b14b9814954052b6e25b94cb.poster.avif?t=1748526037\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717860/extras/b9bb13f9b14b9814954052b6e25b94cb.webm?t=1748526037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717860/extras/b9bb13f9b14b9814954052b6e25b94cb.mp4?t=1748526037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike enemies to build up your energy meter for powerful abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717860/extras/2653e941e95d10db4ea4af4a73420d0d.poster.avif?t=1748526037\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717860/extras/2653e941e95d10db4ea4af4a73420d0d.webm?t=1748526037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717860/extras/2653e941e95d10db4ea4af4a73420d0d.mp4?t=1748526037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill the energy bar to trigger a healing effect that slowly diminishes o